# More Good Reviews MCP routing

## Reputation skills (reputation-report, reputation-actions, review-pipeline)

- Use **More Good Reviews Project API MCP** tools only (`listReviews`, `listCustomers`, `scheduleReviewRequest`, etc.).
- Do **not** use agency MCP tools for these workflows.
- If several project MCPs are connected, pick one consistently or ask which client project to use.
- Ignore agency MCP when running these skills unless the user clearly switched to agency admin work.

## Agency MCP

- Use when the user asks for reseller-level tasks (client businesses, portal clients, team, agency settings).
- Do **not** use agency MCP to fetch review feeds or customer lists for a client; connect or use that client’s **project** MCP instead.

## Writes

- **Review Pipeline** may call `scheduleReviewRequest` only after explicit user approval of the queue.
- Confirm before destructive agency operations (delete project, roll keys, delete clients).
